WEBVTT

00:09:29.398 --> 00:09:32.401
Because today we are
at an inflection point

00:09:32.443 --> 00:09:35.529
with an opportunity
to achieve that vision.

00:09:36.071 --> 00:09:38.657
You know, the Biden administration

00:09:38.657 --> 00:09:41.118
has committed to centering
environmental justice

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:42.786
in all government policies

00:09:42.786 --> 00:09:44.496
through an executive order

00:09:44.496 --> 00:09:47.791
that directs at least
40 percent of the benefits

00:09:47.833 --> 00:09:50.628
from federal investments in clean energy

00:09:50.628 --> 00:09:53.213
to go to disadvantaged communities.

00:09:53.255 --> 00:09:55.299
So there is an opportunity

00:09:55.341 --> 00:09:59.553
to implement a transformative
and accountable process

00:09:59.595 --> 00:10:03.974
for the fair and just distribution
of benefits of Justice40